%SIXMD 1
# @?DIS - DISPLAY PDP-10 INSTRUCTION FIELDS

## DESCRIPTION

READS 36-BIT WORDS FROM FILE OR STANDARD INPUT AND PRINTS OFFSET, WORD, OPCODE, AC, INDIRECT, INDEX, AND ADDRESS FIELDS IN OCTAL.

USAGE IS 'DIS [FILE]'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/DIS
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/DIS.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

